  activityId: Farm
  title: Look after the animals
  story: Before the neighbours meet, the farm animals need your attention. Help prepare
    their pens.
  instructions: '1. Read the requested animal and quantity.

    2. Drag animals
    into the pen, or tap to add them. Tap placed animals to remove them.

    3.
    Repair the pen if needed, then choose Check answer.'
  beforeNumbers: '1. Read the animal name.

    2. Drag or tap the matching animal
    into the pen. Another choice replaces it.

    3. Choose Check answer. Quantities
    become available after a Numbers session.'
